      "created_at": "2012-03-01T13:58:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;ketigid&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"ketigid\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So there’s a flying guy in blue suit on that card’s artwork, presumably a hero, any idea who he might be? Doesn’t look like Legacy to me.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not sure. Not even sure that the suit is blue, as it could just be an effect of the backlighting.</p>\n<p>Since Visionary is clearly on the card, Embolden gives the recipient an extra power, and Visionary can control others, I wonder if this isn’t showing Visionary using something like Wrest the Mind on a 3rd party, though (back to the original question) I don’t know who that backlit, caped, flying person is.</p>",
